{"id":"S2B","file":"S2B_MerchantApp.dc.html","title":"Scene 2B: merchant panel phone mockup","designBg":"#FDF6E9","style":"position: relative; width: 1920px; height: 1080px; overflow: hidden; background: transparent; font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; color: #1E3A26","css":"","html":"\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; display: block\">\n<defs>\n<pattern id=\"s2bDots\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#EAD9BD\"></circle></pattern>\n<radialGradient id=\"s2bGlow\" cx=\"0.5\" cy=\"0.5\" r=\"0.5\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFFFF\" stop-opacity=\"1\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#FFFFFF\" stop-opacity=\"0\"></stop></radialGradient>\n</defs>\n<g data-l=\"0\"><g id=\"S2B_App_BG\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#F0FAEC\"></rect>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"url(#s2bDots)\"></rect>\n<circle cx=\"960\" cy=\"540\" r=\"640\" fill=\"url(#s2bGlow)\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"840\" r=\"210\" fill=\"#BFE3D6\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"1640\" cy=\"230\" r=\"170\" fill=\"#F9DC9C\" opacity=\"0.6\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"1560\" cy=\"900\" r=\"110\" fill=\"#F6B893\" opacity=\"0.5\"></circle>\n</g></g>\n<g data-l=\"1\"><g id=\"S2B_App_PhoneShadow\"><ellipse cx=\"960\" cy=\"1020\" rx=\"270\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#5A3D2B\" opacity=\"0.2\"></ellipse></g></g>\n</svg>\n\n<div id=\"S2B_App_Phone\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 730px; top: 70px; width: 460px; height: 940px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px; border-radius: 56px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 4px solid #D9CDBA; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(90, 61, 43, 0.22)\" data-l=\"2\">\n<div id=\"S2B_App_Screen\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 42px; background: #FBFEF9; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n\n<div id=\"S2B_App_Header\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 34px 26px 22px 26px; background: #E3F4DC\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#3FAE5A\"></rect><rect x=\"12\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1E3A26\" stroke-width=\"3\"></rect><path d=\"M17 24 L30 24 M26 19 L31 24 L26 29\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1E3A26\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2\">পার্সেল তৈরি করুন</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: #3E5A46\">Create Parcel</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<form id=\"S2B_App_Form\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 26px; margin: 0; flex-grow: 1\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<label for=\"s2b-name\" style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: #3E5A46\">প্রাপকের নাম · Recipient name</label>\n<input id=\"s2b-name\" type=\"text\" value=\"মি. হাসান\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 54px; padding: 0 16px; border: 2px solid #E2D5BF; border-radius: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; color: #1E3A26\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<label for=\"s2b-area\" style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: #3E5A46\">ঠিকানা · Delivery area</label>\n<input id=\"s2b-area\" type=\"text\" value=\"ঢাকা\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 54px; padding: 0 16px; border: 2px solid #E2D5BF; border-radius: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; color: #1E3A26\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<label for=\"s2b-item\" style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: #3E5A46\">পণ্য · Item</label>\n<input id=\"s2b-item\" type=\"text\" value=\"শাড়ি × ১\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 54px; padding: 0 16px; border: 2px solid #E2D5BF; border-radius: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Nunito', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; color: #1E3A26\">\n</div>\n<div id=\"S2B_App_CODField\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<label for=\"s2b-cod\" style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; color: #3E5A46\">ক্যাশ অন ডেলিভারি · COD amount</label>\n<input id=\"s2b-cod\" type=\"text\" value=\"৳1,850\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; height: 72px; padding: 0 16px; border: 3px solid #237A3B; border-radius: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 36px; color: #237A3B\">\n</div>\n<div id=\"S2B_App_ChargeRow\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 14px; background: #E4F3EC\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; color: #1E3A26\">ডেলিভারি চার্জ · Delivery charge</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; color: #1B7D4B\">৳70</div>\n</div>\n<button id=\"S2B_App_BookButton\" type=\"button\" style=\"margin-top: auto; height: 68px; border: 0; border-radius: 18px; background: #3FAE5A; color: #1E3A26; font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(217, 84, 0, 0.3)\">বুক করুন · Book</button>\n</form>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"S2B_App_Callout_COD\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 1290px; top: 470px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 22px 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #E2D5BF; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(90, 61, 43, 0.14)\" data-l=\"3\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; color: #3E5A46\" data-l=\"4\">ক্যাশ অন ডেলিভারি</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 84px; line-height: 1; color: #237A3B\" data-l=\"5\">৳1,850</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #3E5A46\" data-l=\"6\">COD AMOUNT</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"S2B_App_Callout_Seller\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 150px; top: 250px; width: 480px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\" data-l=\"7\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Poppins', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #237A3B\" data-l=\"8\">MERCHANT PANEL · FICTIONAL APP</div>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 60px; line-height: 1.2\" data-l=\"9\">অর্ডার বুক করা হচ্ছে</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Nunito', 'Hind Siliguri', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3E5A46\" data-l=\"10\">Nusrat books the parcel from her phone in Barishal.</div>\n</div>\n","layers":[{"l":0,"kind":"svg","id":"S2B_App_BG","depth":"bg"},{"l":1,"kind":"svg","id":"S2B_App_PhoneShadow","depth":"mid"},{"l":2,"kind":"html","id":"S2B_App_Phone","depth":"text","text":"পার্সেল তৈরি করুন Create Parcel প্রাপকের নাম · Recipient name ঠিকানা · Delivery area পণ্য · Item ক্যাশ অন ডেলিভারি · COD amount ডেলিভারি চার্জ · Delivery charge"},{"l":3,"kind":"html","id":"S2B_App_Callout_COD","depth":"text","text":"ক্যাশ অন ডেলিভারি ৳1,850 COD AMOUNT"},{"l":4,"kind":"html-child","id":"","depth":"text","parent":3,"text":"ক্যাশ অন ডেলিভারি"},{"l":5,"kind":"html-child","id":"","depth":"text","parent":3,"text":"৳1,850"},{"l":6,"kind":"html-child","id":"","depth":"text","parent":3,"text":"COD AMOUNT"},{"l":7,"kind":"html","id":"S2B_App_Callout